<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>我的簡單網站</title>
    <style>
      /* 基礎樣式重設 */
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family:
          "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif, "Microsoft JhengHei";
      }

      body {
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
      }

      /* 導覽列 */
      header {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        position: fixed;
        width: 100%;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 1000;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .nav-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #2563eb;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .nav-links li {
        margin-left: 20px;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #555;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: #2563eb;
      }

      /* 主視覺區域 */
      .hero {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #dbeafe 100%);
        padding: 160px 20px 100px 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 48px;
        color: #1e3a8a;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 20px;
        color: #4b5563;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 12px 30px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: background 0.3s;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        background-color: #1d4ed8;
      }

      /* 內容區塊通用樣式 */
      .section {
        padding: 80px 20px;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .section-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 32px;
        color: #1f2937;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      /* 服務項目卡片 */
      .services-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 30px;
      }

      .card {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        text-align: center;
        transition: transform 0.3s;
      }

      .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
      }

      .card-icon {
        font-size: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: #1f2937;
      }

      /* 聯絡我們表單 */
      .contact-form {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }

      .form-group {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .form-group label {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .form-group input,
      .form-group textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 10px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .form-button {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        padding: 12px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        border-radius: 4px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
      }

      .form-button:hover {
        background-color: #1d4ed8;
      }

      /* 頁尾 */
      footer {
        background-color: #1f2937;
        color: #fff;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }

      /* 響應式網頁設計 (手機版面調整) */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .nav-container {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 15px;
        }
        .nav-links li {
          margin: 0 10px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
          font-size: 32px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- 導覽列 -->
    <header>
      <div class="nav-container">
        <div class="logo">MyWebsite</div>
        <nav>
          <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#home">首頁</a></li>
            <li><a href="#services">服務項目</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">聯絡我們</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 主視覺區 -->
    <section id="home" class="hero">
      <h1>歡迎來到我的簡單網站</h1>
      <p>
        這是一個使用純 HTML 與 CSS
        打造的精美響應式網頁。無需安裝任何複雜的框架，即可完美適應手機與電腦螢幕。
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn">立即聯絡</a>
    </section>

    <!-- 服務項目區 -->
    <section id="services" class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">我們的服務</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>網頁設計</h3>
          <p>為您量身打造美觀、流暢且符合品牌形象的現代化網站。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">📱</div>
          <h3>響應式排版</h3>
          <p>確保網站不論在手機、平板還是桌上型電腦，都能展現完美版面。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>效能優化</h3>
          <p>精簡程式碼與圖片，提供最極致的網頁載入速度與使用者體驗。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 聯絡我們區 -->
    <section id="contact" class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">聯絡我們</h2>
      <form
        class="contact-form"
        onsubmit="
          alert('訊息已送出！（這只是前端模擬效果）');
          return false;
        "
      >
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">您的姓名</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="請輸入姓名" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">電子郵件</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            required
            placeholder="example@email.com"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">留言內容</label>
          <textarea
            id="message"
            rows="5"
            required
            placeholder="請輸入您想說的話..."
          ></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="form-button">送出訊息</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <!-- 頁尾 -->
    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 我的簡單網站. 保留所有權利。</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
